= Turkish Aerial Forces

In an amphibious invasion, the cooperation with aerial forces will prove crucial for success. However we should be careful how we utilize our armed forces; these are weapons of destruction we are controlling.

- @strike: Strike positions in [+ cyprus_target_district_label +]
- @paratrooper: Land paratroopers in [+ cyprus_target_district_label +]
- @root: Don't take any aerial actions for now.

@strike
choose-if: military_strength >= 10;
unavailable-subtitle: We dont have enough military resources!
on-arrival: military_strength -= 10; leverage_points += 2

Our aerial forces attacked military positions in [+ cyprus_target_district_label +].

@paratrooper
choose-if: military_strength >= 10;
